# U-Boot environment on the IO Extender's NAND: two redundant copies, 128 KiB
# each, one erase block each. Size and redundancy were read off the unit by
# checking which length makes the stored CRC match (0x20000, with the 1-byte
# redundancy flag after the CRC). mtd0/mtd3 are "u-boot-env" and
# "u-boot-env-redundant" in this board's device tree.
# device      offset  env-size  sector-size
/dev/mtd0     0x0     0x20000   0x20000
/dev/mtd3     0x0     0x20000   0x20000
